{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1000", "sample_idx": 2, "model_name": "meta/llama-4-maverick-17b-128e-instruct", "content": "Raymond III Count of Tripoli was a nobleman and a leader of the Crusader state of Tripoli. He was born around 1140 and died in 1187. Raymond was the son of Raymond II Count of Tripoli and Hodierna of Jerusalem. After his father's assassination in 1152 *Early Life and Reign* Raymond III succeeded him as Count of Tripoli at a very young age with his mother acting as regent. \n\nAs Raymond grew older he became involved in the politics of the Crusader states. He was a cousin of King Amalric I of Jerusalem and played a significant role in the kingdom's government. In 1164 Raymond was captured by Nur ad-Din Zangi during the Crusader defeat at the Battle of Harim. He was released in 1174 after spending about 10 years in captivity. Upon his release Raymond returned to Tripoli and began to consolidate his power.\n\n*Regency in Jerusalem* Raymond's experience in captivity and his lack of children made him a shrewd politician. In 1174 he was appointed regent for King Baldwin IV of Jerusalem who was suffering from leprosy. Raymond's regency was marked by his efforts to secure the kingdom's future by arranging marriages and alliances. However his influence was limited by the opposing faction led by Miles of Plancy.\n\nIn 1180 Raymond's regency ended with the coming of age of Baldwin IV. However he continued to play a significant role in the kingdom's politics. *The Battle of Hattin and Death* In 1187 Raymond was one of the leaders of the Crusader army at the Battle of Hattin where they were defeated by Saladin. The battle was a disaster for the Crusaders and it led to the loss of Jerusalem. Raymond escaped from the battlefield but died soon after from pleurisy at the age of around 47 in Tripoli. He was succeeded by his godson Raymond IV Count of Tripoli who was the son of Bohemond III of Antioch. Raymond III's death marked the end of an era for the County of Tripoli and the Crusader states.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Ray", "logprob": -0.011065427213907242}, {"token": "mond", "logprob": -1.4305104514278355e-06}, {"token": " III", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Count", "logprob": -0.0003358753747306764}, {"token": " of", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Trip", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "oli", "logprob": -1.4305104514278355e-06}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.0014659145381301641}, {"token": " nob", "logprob": -0.19680620729923248}, {"token": "leman", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.044186003506183624}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -0.3750428855419159}, {"token": " leader", "logprob": -0.38863593339920044}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.00248873233795166}, {"token": " the", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " Crus", "logprob": -1.3182767629623413}, {"token": "ader", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " state", "logprob": -0.10650692880153656}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.011544330045580864}, {"token": " Trip", "logprob": -0.13284537196159363}, {"token": "oli", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.006045981775969267}, {"token": " He", "logprob": -0.00022015532886143774}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -0.00012385078298393637}, {"token": " born", "logprob": -0.023820877075195312}, {"token": " around", "logprob": -0.47408145666122437}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "114", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "0", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.0005530973430722952}, {"token": " died", "logprob": -0.3894580602645874}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -3.814689989667386e-06}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -5.006777428206988e-06}, {"token": "118", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "7", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.0001629458274692297}, {"token": " Raymond", "logprob": -0.13399957120418549}, {"token": " was", "logprob": -0.03120921179652214}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.0005565524916164577}, {"token": " son", "logprob": -